flowchart TD
  A[Declare acceptance criteria] --> B[Hash and lock the criteria]
  B --> C[Score candidates under blind labels]
  C --> D{Any candidate meets the criteria?}
  D -->|No| E[Stop. Record nothing as accepted]
  D -->|Yes| F[Record acceptance for that exact candidate]
  F --> G{Activation flag: acceptance recorded?}
  G -->|No, fail-closed| H[Activation refused]
  G -->|Yes| I[Activate by configuration]
  I --> J[Bounded synthetic smoke, hard ceiling]
  J --> K[Assert serving model from telemetry]
  K --> L{Confirmed?}
  L -->|No| M[Rollback exercise]
  L -->|Yes| N[Human review before any final action]
